OL,5,G2305 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,6,     FBea tells the women to keep quiet
OL,7,     Fabout Jacki's relationship with
OL,8,     FJim or risk having her transferred
OL,9,     Fto Barnhurst. A reporter arrives,
OL,10,     Flooking for an angle on Jacki's
OL,11,     Fstory.
OL,12,G0010 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,13,     FMeg asks Erica to be her matron of
OL,14,     Fhonour. A new prisoner, Anne
OL,15,     FGriffin, is brought to Wentworth
OL,16,     Fcharged with armed robbery after
OL,17,     Fholding up a shopkeeper with a
OL,18,     Fknife.
